OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas trees warning after
OL,4,Asummer heatwave
OL,5,
OL,6,F"If we have more summers like the last
OL,7,Ftwo, we'll be struggling as a nation to
OL,8,Fproduce enough Christmas trees."
OL,10,FAndrew Ingram owns The Tree Barn in
OL,11,FChristmas Common, Oxfordshire, which is
OL,12,Fhome to about 120,000 trees.
OL,14,FBut this year's hot summer and drought
OL,15,Fhas reduced that total by more than a
OL,16,Fthousand.
OL,18,F"It's been an extraordinary year," he
OL,19,Fsaid. "We planted in perfect conditions
OL,20,Fin March and then it didn't rain for 12
OL,21,Fweeks until the first week of June.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
